cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and this software archive."
title: "Candidate microRNA regulation of O-GlcNAc-related enzymes in breast cancer drug resistance: analysis code and processed results"
abstract: >-
  Code, processed result tables and figure scripts for an observational integrative
  analysis of twelve candidate microRNA-enzyme pairs (OGT, OGA, EOGT) in TCGA-BRCA
  and in public resistant cell models, prioritizing miR-200c/EOGT as a hypothesis
  for functional validation.
